  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量千川-随心推全域\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量千川\"],\"capability_summary\":\"获取随心推全域订单数据，当前仅支持获取商品全域订单，可根据日期、时间粒度、过滤条件等进行查询，并支持排序和分页。\",\"id\":\"qianchuan.aweme_uni_promotion_order_report.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/aweme/uni_promotion/order/report/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1844129628513816\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用本接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"appendix_return_code\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"本接口的返回码和返回信息说明可参考此文档\",\"relation\":\"配合文档\",\"title\":\"【附录-返回码】\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1844129628513816\",\"title\":\"获取随心推全域订单数据\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2d3BjFUp\">获取随心推全域订单数据，当前仅支持获取商品全域订单</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201843429346050508%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201748264006369288%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-ozo9b8yt\" id=\"h346b9f0-ozo9b8yt\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-udNJ333U\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/aweme/uni_promotion/order/report/get/<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1844129628513816\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1777555692984388\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1839622960207943\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-kMyXce7I\" id=\"h346b9f0-kMyXce7I\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-BpIA0OO9\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-0plrZe8L\" id=\"h346b9f0-0plrZe8L\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-vZtKIFMc\" id=\"h346b9f0-vZtKIFMc\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 264px;\" width=\"264\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-pZr1NSHu\">客户id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">start_date</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">查询数据开始日期，例如2021-04-05，开始时间不可超过「当前日期-180天」</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">end_date</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">查询数据结束日期，例如2021-04-05，日期跨度不能超过180天</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">time_granularity</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">时间粒度 ，如果不传，返回查询日期内的聚合数据 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-37p4kom1ckg000\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Bemk0TJh\"><code>TIME_GRANULARITY_DAILY</code>：(按天维度),会返回每天的数据</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-6kVTGfCl\"><code>TIME_GRANULARITY_HOURLY</code>：(按小时维度)，会返回每小时维度的数据</li></ul><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-28plwma6cl8g00\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\"><strong>注意：当选择按小时维度返回时，日期跨度不能超过7天，超过7天接口会拦截报错</strong></span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filter</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\">过滤条件</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">ad_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-69l6Zhsu\">随心商品投放全域计划id（非order_id），最多支持100个</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">order_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">排序类型 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-4N0RB6cE\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QZaqxeoA\"><code>ASC</code> 升序</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-3LzfVkoC\"><code>DESC</code> 降序（默认）</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">order_field</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">排序字段 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-33eMj1hn\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-LXTh5lA7\"><code>total_pay_order_gmv_for_roi2</code> 用户实际支付金额</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-inD3pklr\"><code>stat_cost_for_roi2</code> 整体消耗</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-pIlPBQps\"><code>total_prepay_and_pay_order_roi2</code> 整体支付ROI</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-eIFigIYo\"><code>total_pay_order_count_for_roi2</code> 整体成交订单数</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-quRFVZ0N\"><code>total_pay_order_coupon_amount_for_roi2</code> 整体成交智能优惠券金额</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ptrIRjJE\"><code>total_unfinished_estimate_order_gmv_for_roi2</code> 整体未完结预售订单预估金额</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-c4wMMMd5\"><code>total_ecom_platform_subsidy_amount_for_roi2</code> 平台补贴金额</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-h7jhnD9M\"><code>total_pay_order_gmv_include_coupon_for_roi2</code> 整体成交金额</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4crf8exmyg0000\"><code>otal_prepay_and_pay_settle_roi2_1h</code>净成交ROIt</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4xxrbxr4n7g000\">\n<code>total_order_settle_amount_for_roi2_1h</code>净成交金额</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-33400cwi7tm000\"><code>total_order_settle_count_for_roi2_1h</code> 净成交订单数</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4mno55933us000\"><code>total_cost_per_pay_order_settle_for_roi2_1h</code>净成交订单成本</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">页码，默认值：1</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page_size</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-FbiHWJHs\">页面大小，允许值：10, 20, 50, 100，默认值：10 </p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-kIrcdP6W\" id=\"h346b9f0-kIrcdP6W\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv1.0%2Fqianchuan%2Faweme%2Funi_promotion%2Forder%2Freport%2Fget%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%